flowchart LR
    ADMIN[Admin and secure remote access] --> CTRL[Ansible controller]
    CTRL -. automates .-> HOSTS[Linux / Unix service hosts]
    CLIENT[Simulated workload] --> PROXY[Ingress and PgBouncer]
    PROXY --> PRIMARY[PostgreSQL primary]
    PROXY -. standby connection path .-> STANDBY[PostgreSQL standby - bare metal]
    PRIMARY -->|WAL replication| STANDBY
    HOSTS --> LOGS[Centralized logs]
    HOSTS --> METRICS[Prometheus / Grafana / Loki]
